From fea1e39c2000af5aac91a212d899e1560085870a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Diego Amicabile <diego.amicabile@soprasteria.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 14:29:43 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Restrict the Lunal take skip to non-munchkin mode

The source fix skips every item borg_flow_take_lunal() marks bad.  In
munchkin mode the borg deliberately collects what it can sell (the value
test clears item_bad for those), and with the skip active the take flow
returns false more often, so the borg falls into the climb branch and
oscillates dive/climb at shallow depth (frozen cohort: seeds 11/29/47 end
2-3 levels shallower).

Keep the skip on the Lunal scumming path the defect was reported for, and
leave munchkin mode's collection alone.  Size the effect per mode: all
modes (merged 0101) shifts the cohort, non-munchkin does not.
---
 src/borg/borg-flow-take.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/borg/borg-flow-take.c b/src/borg/borg-flow-take.c
index a2523f6e2..135a27da3 100644
--- a/src/borg/borg-flow-take.c
+++ b/src/borg/borg-flow-take.c
@@ -839,7 +839,7 @@ bool borg_flow_take_lunal(bool viewable, int nearness)
         }
 
         /* Skip items the Borg does not want */
-        if (item_bad)
+        if (item_bad && !borg_cfg[BORG_MUNCHKIN_START])
             continue;
 
         /* Get the grid */
-- 
